{"page":424,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:44","surah":33,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"تَحِيَّتُهُمْ يَوْمَ يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ سَلَـٰمٌ ۚ وَأَعَدَّ لَهُمْ أَجْرًا كَرِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"when they meet Him they will be greeted with ‘Peace’- and He has prepared a generous reward for them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"تَحِيَّتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"Their greetings","transliteration":"taḥiyyatuhum","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"they will meet Him","transliteration":"yalqawnahu","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَلَـٰمٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(will be), \"Peace","transliteration":"salāmun","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"and He has prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَجْرًۭا","en_gloss":"a reward","transliteration":"ajran","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَرِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"noble","transliteration":"karīman","verse_key":"33:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:44"}]},{"verse_key":"33:45","surah":33,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ إِنَّآ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ شَـٰهِدًا وَمُبَشِّرًا وَنَذِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Prophet, We have sent you as a witness, as a bearer of good news and warning,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O Prophet","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"33:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"O Prophet","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","verse_key":"33:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"33:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"have sent you","transliteration":"arsalnāka","verse_key":"33:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَـٰهِدًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a witness","transliteration":"shāhidan","verse_key":"33:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمُبَشِّرًۭا",